---
import Note from './Note.astro';
---

<Note>
	<p>
		If you're using the auto-provisioned <code>Enterprise Core</code> instance included with your Production License deployment, set the base URL to: <code>https://ENTERPRISE_PUBLIC_URL/core</code>.
	</p>
	<p>If you're connecting to a different Core instance, use the publicly accessible base URL for that instance instead.</p>
</Note>
<h3>Authorization</h3>
<p>
	If set, the API uses an API key for authentication. Include the following header in your requests: <code>X-blnk-key: &lt;api-key&gt;</code>.
</p>
<p>
	Replace <code>&lt;api-key&gt;</code> with your secret API key. Ensure the key is kept secure and not exposed in public repositories or client-side code.
</p>
<p>See also: <a href="/api-keys/overview">Scoped API keys</a> and <a href="/advanced/secure-blnk">Secure your Blnk server</a>.</p>
